Shader Animation Generator

Powered by Paper Shaders:
https://shaders.paper.design

The pattern shader adapts Paper Shaders' Warp shader (Apache-2.0).
Modifications include six-color blending, grain, parameter mapping and the
React renderer. The library is not used as a runtime dependency.

The fluid noise functions derive from Ashima Arts / Stefan Gustavson
webgl-noise (MIT).

